00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:09.660
They're the people who let us and allow us
and enable us to make this content.

00:10:09.660 --> 00:10:11.160
We are so grateful for them.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:16.620
I really love that we get to make this show
and then I, along with you, get to keep learning

00:10:16.620 --> 00:10:19.260
more and more about the microcosmos.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:21.060
So thank you so much to all those people.

00:10:21.060 --> 00:10:25.260
If you want to become one of them, you can
go to Patreon.com/JourneytoMicro.

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:28.560
If you want to see more from our Master of
